worker changes. Do not weaken the acceptance predicate to hide a difference.\",\"Inspect the fresh conformance JSON for complete observations, diagnostics, semantic and binding projections, requirement coverage for MC02/MC04/MC10/MC20/MC23/MC24, unsupported capabilities, manifest fields and explicit accounting/forecast/human-acceptance nonclaims.\",\"Update progress.md (under 600 words) with the fresh suite/checker results, exact changed files, protected-hash outcome and any unfinished deliverable. Regenerate result.md from the same fresh run and ensure it states bounded engineering conformance only.\",\"Re-run the unittest suite and checker after any repair, then verify all declared output files exist and hashes for contributed source/test/profile/catalog files match the conformance manifest.\",\"If the fresh run passes, submit conformance.json and result.md for result review. If it fails, return the exact failing obligation or provenance mismatch and keep P03 unaccepted; do not claim G2/G12/G15 closure.\"],\"residuals\":[\"General language features, arbitrary mappings, multiple entities/books/observations, events, postings, currencies/calendars, cross-company concepts and broader uncertainty remain unsupported.\",\"The phase cannot establish accounting validity, empirical forecast validity, authoring superiority, whole-program completeness or human acceptance.\",\"Current one-run deterministic evidence does not support stochastic or performance claims; no such claims should be added.\"],\"steps\":[\"Preserve the current bounded implementation and first reconcile checker baseline/provenance semantics with the historical phase-entry and repair-entry records.\",\"Execute the mandatory unit tests and complete catalog checker, repairing only observed checker/report defects.\",\"Regenerate conformance.json, result.md and progress.md from the fresh execution, with explicit decision and nonclaim tables.\",\"Perform final read-only integrity inspection of outputs, source hashes and protected files, then hand off for P03 result review.\"],\"summary\":\"P03 implementation is substantially present and the current nine-method suite passes, but the prior process timed out and the existing report/checkpoint are stale. The remaining plan is a bounded fresh execution and provenance/report repair: make the checker distinguish historical protected-file differences from new mutations, regenerate clean deliverables, and verify every catalog obligation before acceptance. The planned evidence supports only deterministic Core0.1 engineering conformance; G2, G12, G15 and all wider accounting, forecasting and human-acceptance obligations remain open.\",\"verdict\":\"PLAN\"}"}}
